        "message": "=<div style=\"background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n  <table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e3e8ee;\">\n\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"background:#2e7d5b;padding:20px 28px;\">\n        <div style=\"color:#d7f0e2;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;\">Toplantı görevi</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:4px;\">Sana yeni bir görev atandı</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:28px;color:#2b2f36;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">\n          Merhaba {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').all().find(r => String(r.json['E-posta']).trim().toLowerCase() === String($('If').item.json['output.gorevler'].sorumlu_email).trim().toLowerCase())?.json['Ad Soyad'] || '' }},\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;\">Son toplantının notlarından aşağıdaki görev sana atandı:</p>\n\n        <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f9f6;border-left:4px solid #2e7d5b;border-radius:6px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:16px 18px;\">\n              <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">Görev</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#1f2933;margin-top:4px;\">\n                {{ $('If').item.json['output.gorevler'].gorev }}\n              </div>\n\n              <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-top:14px;\">Son tarih</div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#1f2933;margin-top:4px;\">\n                {{ DateTime.fromISO($('If').item.json['output.gorevler'].tarih).toFormat('dd.MM.yyyy') }}\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0 8px 0;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#2e7d5b;border-radius:8px;\">\n              <a href=\"{{ $json.url }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#ffffff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">\n                Trello kartını aç\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0 0;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;\">Kolay gelsin.</p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"background:#f4f6f8;padding:14px 28px;color:#9aa3af;font-size:12px;text-align:center;\">\n        Bu mesaj toplantı notlarından otomatik oluşturuldu.\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n  </table>\n</div>",
